|DATA EXPORTED FROM HORNRESP - RESONANCES NOT MASKED

|COMMENT: NEW RECORD - NEW RECORD - NEW RECORD - NEW RECORD - Default horn loudspeaker

|~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

|REQUIRED AKABAK SETTINGS:

|File > Preferences > Physical system constants:

|Sound velocity c = 344m/s
|Medium density rho = 1.205kg/m3

|Sum > Acoustic power:

|Frequency range = 10Hz to 20kHz
|Points = 533
|Input voltage = 2.83V rms
|Integration = 2Pi-sr
|Integration steps = 1 degree ... 1 degree
|Integration method = Cross

|~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Def_Const |Hornresp Input Parameter Values
{
|Length, area and volume values converted to metres, square metres and cubic metres:

S1  =   150.00e-4;  |Horn segment 1 throat area (sq m)
S2  =   400.00e-4;  |Horn segment 1 mouth area and horn segment 2 throat area (sq m)
S3  =   400.00e-4;  |Horn segment 2 mouth area and horn segment 3 throat area (sq m)
S4  =   900.00e-4;  |Horn segment 3 mouth area and horn segment 4 throat area (sq m)
S5  =  1200.00e-4;  |Horn segment 4 mouth area (sq m)

L12 =    35.00e-2;  |Horn segment 1 axial length (m)
L23 =    25.00e-2;  |Horn segment 2 axial length (m)
L34 =   100.00e-2;  |Horn segment 3 axial length (m)
L45 =    30.00e-2;  |Horn segment 4 axial length (m)

|Parameter Conversions:

Sd  = 350.00e-4;  |Diaphragm area (sq m)
}
|~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

|Network node numbers for this tapped horn system:

|     0-Voltage-1
|               |
|           -Driver-------------
|          |                    |
|8-Segment-9-Segment-10-Segment-11-Segment-12-Radiator

|~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Def_Driver 'Driver'

  Sd=350.00cm2
  Bl=18.00Tm
  Cms=4.00E-04m/N
  Rms=4.00Ns/m
  fs=51.62Hz  |Mmd = 20.00g not recognised by AkAbak, fs calculated and used instead
  Le=1.00mH
  Re=6.00ohm
  ExpoLe=1

System 'System'

  Driver Def='Driver''Driver'
    Node=1=0=9=11

  Waveguide 'Horn segment 1'
    Node=8=9
    STh={S1}
    SMo={S2}
    Len={L12}
    Conical

  Duct 'Horn segment 2'
    Node=9=10
    SD={S2}
    Len={L23}
    Visc=0

  Waveguide 'Horn segment 3'
    Node=10=11
    STh={S3}
    SMo={S4}
    Len={L34}
    Conical

  Waveguide 'Horn segment 4'
    Node=11=12
    STh={S4}
    SMo={S5}
    Len={L45}
    Conical

  Radiator 'Horn mouth'
    Node=12
    SD={S5}
